<td>[<b>203</b>] <font color=#006400><b>10/5亀DropItemのRoll</b></font></td>
<td width=10>　</td><td>投稿者：<font color=#0000FF><b>Valo</b></font></td>
<td align=right>　<small>投稿日：2001/10/06(Sat) 03:19:33</small></td></tr></table>
<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="800000"><br>10/5PoH参加者で亀DropItemのRollをします。今回は対象者があいまいですが、そこは各自の判断にゆだねます。<br>User希望者はLotto番号付きで、それ以外All扱いにします。<br>User希望なかった物がAllになります。<br>Random0-1000で振って下さい。<br>締め切りは10/7日PM23：59迄。<br><br>[1]Section of Lodizal shell(Lodizalell shield)<br>Classes:  Bards, Clerics, Druids, Paladins, Rangers, Rogues, Shadow Knights, Shamans, Warriors<br>Races:  All Races<br>Stats:  23 AC -5 AGI +5 CHA +10 STR +10 WIS +20 SV COLD +20 SV FIRE +10 SV MAGIC<br>Special Attributes:  MAGIC, LORE<br>Slot(s):  Back, Off Hand Slot<br>Weight:  5 Stone<br>Effect:  Endure Breath   <br><br>[2]CLUB OF THE ICE OCEAN <br>Classes:  Clerics, Paladins, Rangers, Shadow Knights, Shamans, Warriors<br>Races:  All Races<br>Type: 1H Blunt<br>Damage: 14<br>Delay: 27<br>Stats:  +10 HP +3 STR<br>Special Attributes:  MAGIC, LORE<br>Slot(s):  Off Hand Slot, Primary Hand Slot<br>Weight:  3.5 Stone<br>Effect:  Frost Strike   <br><br>[3]LODIZAL SHELL BOOTS <br>Classes:  Bards, Paladins, Rangers, Rogues, Shadow Knights, Warriors<br>Races:  All Races<br>Stats:  14 AC +20 HP +7 STR<br>Special Attributes:  MAGIC, LORE<br>Slot(s):  Feet Slot<br>Weight:  0.1 Stone<br>Effect:  Turtle Skin   <br><br>[4]Garou drop no Piecering<br><br>[5]Garou drop shm spell(39?)<br></font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
 <font color=#000000>Eiyoso@IE：780</font><br>
 <font color=#000000>Sayla@BoG：473</font><br>
 <font color=#000000>Rabbitfoot@BoG：174</font><br>
 <font color=#000000>Bancho：78</font><br>
 <font color=#000000>MAXs：29</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Griffis：976</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Valo：768</font><br>
