<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="0000FF"><br>PoF のitemです<br>lotno　付きはwilluser　でなしはallrollですどちらかに振ってください。<br>期限は9/28金　までです。<br><br>（1）Amulet of Necropotence<br>Races: HUM ERU HIE DEF GNM - Classes: NEC WIZ MAG ENC (MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 0 - Wt: 0.1 - Slot: neck<br>Attributes: INT+13 HP-100 SV MAGIC+10 <br>Effect: Illusion: Skeleton<br><br>（2）Lyssa's Darkwood Piccolo<br>Races: HUM ELF HEF - Classes: BRD (MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 0 - Wt: 0.1 - Slot: instruments<br><br>（3）Blood Fire<br>Races: ALL - Classes: WAR (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: Damage: 11 - Dly: 24 - Wt: 2.5 - Type: 1hs - Damage Per <br>Second: 9.58<br>Effect: Boil Blood (600 point DOT)<br><br>（4）Bone-Clasped Girdle<br>Races: ALL - Classes: BRD CLR DRU ENC MAG NEC SHM WIZ (MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 4 - Wt: 0.1 - Slot: waist<br>Attributes: STR+7 DEX+7 STA+7 HP+75 MANA+75 <br><br><br>（ALL）Bone Razor<br>Races: ALL - Classes: ROG (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: Damage: 10 - Dly: 22 - Wt: 1.5 - Type: piercing - Damage Per <br>Second: 9.55<br><br>（ALL）Flayed Tourmoilskin Belt　×　２<br>Races: ALL - Classes: SHM (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 9 - Wt: 0.5 - Slot: waist<br>Attributes: DEX+6 WIS+5<br><br>（ALL）Diamond ×　１<br></font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
